        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Submitted</dt>
          <dd id='conf-timestamp'></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Documents in packet</dt>
          <dd id='conf-docs'></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <dl class='kv' id='conf-kv'></dl>

    <ol class='next'>
      <li>Quote the reference number above in any call or email about this claim. <em>(Staged: the reference exists only in this browser session.)</em></li>
      <li>Intake would index the packet and confirm whether anything further is required. <em>(Staged: no packet is transmitted.)</em></li>
      <li>Progress would be tracked under Claims &rsaquo; Submission status in SponsorConnect. <em>(Staged: that screen is not part of this demo.)</em></li>
    </ol>

    <div class='conf-actions'>
